# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Build context of services/server/Dockerfile (the repository root, as in release.yml). BuildKit
# reads this file instead of a root .dockerignore, so other builds are not affected. Everything
# is ignored except the sources the binary is built from; tests and test data never enter the
# context. Embedded files live in migrations/ (migrations/embed.go), which is allowed.
*
!services/server/go.mod
!services/server/go.sum
!services/server/VERSION
!services/server/api/
!services/server/cmd/
!services/server/internal/
!services/server/migrations/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
